{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_14_level_main_14-18_beg","groupId":"main_14","stageId":"main_14-18","title":"列王行迹","storyCode":"14-20","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-18_beg.txt","sourceHash":"6a23f77f9d86e621aa56b2622637add7c19c0c068468e00a2ab430016ddc371b","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g11_rhodesdeck_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宇宙......什么宇宙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们所熟知的语言中并不包括这个词语。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它是远比天空与大地还要广阔的概念，是所有的时间与空间，以及被它包含的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即便是最为傲慢的“神明”都不该宣称自己能够掌握宇宙的全部。因为这个词语本身就象征着无穷的边界，以及时刻变化的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，源石会将这一切悉数纳入，在其内部形成一个“内化宇宙”——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，两件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一、不知道什么原因，我们跟着飞空艇一头扎进了源石里面——天知道为什么小小的石头里面居然会有这么宽敞的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二、我们还没死，不知道以什么方式还活在源石内部的，“宇宙”里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可以这么理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？什么反应都没有，连个泡都没冒吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"W小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚你扔出去的......呃，是炸弹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我总得摸索一下。你就当炸弹是我的手好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老女人说我们被关在源石里了，说不定我碰到边界，顺便炸出个——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——刚刚怎么回事？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就好像......有什么东西拽了我一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"底下那黄色的东西是液态源石吗？炸弹炸到什么玩意了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炸弹并未引爆，因为缺乏能量反应条件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这片源石海中，我完全感知不到源石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......或许可以理解，毕竟外部的源石皆是以与其他物质结合的形式存在，亦必须符合外部“宇宙”的规则。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而此处的源石，即是规则本身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这话还不如老女人说的好懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已进入另一套语法之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能察觉到这片源石海洋中包含的......语言。浩瀚，磅礴，无边无际。我目前尚不能彻底解析。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下来，Logos。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少在此时此地，别再尝试去理解这“语言”。我们不能过多......扰动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然我们很可能已在危险的注视之下，但这艘船被允许存在，就证明我们暂时是安全的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"罗德岛？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"船和源石海......","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这艘罗德岛......是因你而存在，Dr.{@nickname}。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们本应被源石同化，成为这片海洋的一部分。是你救了我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你修改......不，重新制定了部分规则。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你自己都没有察觉的情况下，你使用了那种“语言”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"刚刚我说的那种吗？可我记不得了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"它好像在我脑子里，又好像不在。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？这个家伙还有这种能耐？你不会想告诉我，船上那些莫名其妙的场景，也都是这家伙的一场梦吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那“温暖人心”的幻想可真是......恶心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我也并不喜欢。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"W转过头去，略带思索地看向前方。\n在进入内化宇宙后，她的视线就很少落在你身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"问题的关键来了，我们撞进了这片源石里面，还有没有办法出去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这艘装满了幽灵的船，准备带我们去什么地方？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"罗德岛航行在金色的海洋上。水面看起来毫无涟漪，更像是一面纯金色的镜子。\n一个疑问突然击中了你——你们真的是在航行吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"海面好像是静止的......所有东西都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太安静了，我什么都感觉不到。流动的情感，充实的记忆......全部消失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希医生，这里是源石内部，不是吗？源石明明吞吃了那么多东西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毁于天灾的城市，死于矿石病的人......所有生命存在过的痕迹，它们不该都在这片海洋里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么......这里什么都没有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为这里是......尽头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"万物尽数被源石封存，无法改变，也不会毁灭的尽头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真棒啊，一个连死都不会死的“好”去处，拉特兰都没这么神圣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难怪船上没有萨卡兹。这么温馨甜蜜的好地方，怎么可能——容得下我们这种妖魔鬼怪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没有萨卡兹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好像确实是这样......从刚才开始，除了W小姐和Logos先生，的确没有见到任何一个萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹......与源石紧密相连的萨卡兹，都去了哪里？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"船撞上了什么......？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"海面上有东西？！","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“看见”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“萨卡兹”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1340_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些影子，是萨卡兹！他们正在——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——行军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"战争始终在继续，无论在外面的战场上，还是在这里......亦无论是活着，还是死去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"水面上出现无数萨卡兹的影子。\n温迪戈，炎魔，食腐者，女妖......以及许多被时间磨灭的古老氏族。\n他们有的拿着棍棒长枪，有的拿着弓弩长剑，有的背靠巫术火炮。\n水面是静止的，而这些身影构成洪流，向前奔涌而去。\n冲锋。厮杀。\n永不止歇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"战争。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹与万物之间的战争，持续万年，从未结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原来，这即是，萨卡兹的众魂归处。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“我见诸城，满目疮痍。\n\\n\\n“我见源石，遍布大地。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g1_originiumcanyon"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛本舰就在前面了，坚持住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夜莺","speakerId":"avg_179_cgbird_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沉重的喘息）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛嘉烈","speakerId":"avg_1014_nearl2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"闪灵？你怎么了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那扇门已经打开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死与生的距离，前所未有地近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪灵","speakerId":"avgnew_147_shining_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有的萨卡兹，都能听见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g1_giantmonstercockpit"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"扛住这一轮冲击！飞空艇被源石吞噬，王庭术师暂时管不到这里！这是我们唯一的机会，脊椎的损伤太大了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫德雷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我听见了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊内丝","speakerId":"avg_4087_ines_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巨兽又对你说话了？说什么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......是另外的声音......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫德雷","speakerId":"avg_4088_hodrer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我听见，历史中所有的战争，都在同时进行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g15_origindecisivebattlefield"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"因陀罗","speakerId":"avg_155_tiger_1","isRemote":false,"text":"维娜，你看！伦蒂尼姆上面——那坨红色的玩意儿是不是又变大了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不仅变大了，而且红得发黑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"摩根","speakerId":"avg_npc_405_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就跟......整个天空都在变成源石一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......风暴并没有真正止歇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"诸王之息覆盖不了更大的范围......萨卡兹会毁掉整座城市，甚至远远不止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"推进之王","speakerId":"avgnew_112_siege_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们一定要赶上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g11_rhodesdeck_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"众魂......拦住了我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这个一切事物都因源石静止的地方，只有众魂，还在抗争......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"所有人都听到了，回荡在金色海面上低沉的怒吼。\n萨卡兹的战争不会停止，萨卡兹的愤怒没有尽头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有意思，萨卡兹死掉的老英雄们就在眼前鞠躬尽瘁，“不得好死”说的就是这种情况吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是他们为什么要拦在我们前面......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们前面这树根一样的东西，它看起来是不是很像一座塔？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"从踏上甲板的那刻起，你就注意到了它。\n它矗立在你们视野的最中央，与金色的水面和寂静的天空既融为一体，又格格不入。\n那真的是一座塔吗？\n假如它真的是一座塔的话，它一定高得超乎想象。\n为什么在源石的海洋里，万物静滞的尽头，会有一座塔？\n答案呼之欲出。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......巴别塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"从一开始，飞空艇的目的地就是这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她就在那座塔上，她在带领着萨卡兹众魂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是的，她在等我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那座塔......是这片没有方向的海洋里，唯一的信标。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所有的答案，都在我们的起点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们会登上巴别塔......走向她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"然后......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g11_rhodesdeck_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿米娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我清醒得很。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都走到这里了......我不可能搞不清楚自己想要什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么多活人还在外头拼命呢，再不快点的话，我们马上就该在这里见到更多眼熟的英雄坯子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老女人，让你的小怪物也出来干点活！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"过去的路不会很好走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......做不到。Mon3tr无法出现在这里，我也不希望引起一些不必要的注意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，又是些你不能说的理由吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，这里对我有很多限制，但对你，不会有任何的影响。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要你让这艘舰船动起来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我并没有真正掌过舵。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"这里是甲板不是舰桥......","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你并不需要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这艘罗德岛将驶向何方，并不依赖于你的驾驶技巧，或者任何机械和能源装置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是源石的内部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你早已发现，源石于你而言，有着特殊的意义。而你对于源石，同样无可取代。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我以为我不该知道这些。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我以为你不会对我说这些。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的沉默有许多原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"坦诚地说，我对你是否应该找回这些知识，也仍有疑虑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"因为我曾经做过的事......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我现在理解了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你说过，你恨我。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恨，痛苦，愤怒，我全都无法否认。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那一个时刻，我失去的并不只有特蕾西娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有......另一个我曾希望能够信任的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......是我。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你感到失望。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很失望......对我自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我并未完全察觉到你的“改变”。或者说，我所做的准备不足以扭转当时的结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们曾窥见过实现理想的曙光，而特蕾西娅仓促的离去熄灭了炬火。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们已再度步入最深的黑夜里，如果不能做出最正确的选择，这一刻的黑暗将成为永恒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"或许你的确不该再信任我。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。我理应信任你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的确担心让你重拾与源石相关的回忆......会再度带来不可预料的改变。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你已一次又一次地向我，向阿米娅，向所有人证明......我担心的事并不会成真。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我唯一能确定的是，我们是同行者。从切尔诺伯格到伦蒂尼姆，你的经历，你的情感，塑造了如今的你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像此时此刻——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你保护了我们，令我们不至于立刻被源石吞噬，变成庞杂的信息流的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你让罗德岛出现，让我们能在静滞中保有继续前行的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Dr.{@nickname}，为你自己指明出路吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们的未来是何走向，罗德岛会驶向何方——将由你的意志决定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"好。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我一直知道。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"罗德岛——","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"前进。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"你清晰地感觉到脚下的船在前行。\n穿过源石的海洋。穿过众魂的军阵。\n塔越来越近。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g11_rhodesdeck_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这海怎么突然发起疯来？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"众魂正在影响周遭环境。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"内化宇宙......不再稳定。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"罗德岛很难再往前了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"这些已故的萨卡兹正阻碍我们。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"众魂很愤怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们——全都看向了这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"行，爱看就看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":"avg_1035_wisdel_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看着我，怎么踩在他们头顶——跨过去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"巨浪像手掌一样拍向小小的罗德岛。\nW咧嘴笑了。\n她迎着浪潮纵身一跃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——W小姐！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"W的身影瞬间消失在惊涛骇浪之中。\n但下一刻，她的笑声就从金色的雾中传了出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我就知道——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这玩意儿不属于源石海，一定能炸开！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真没想到——我会想要拆开——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"W","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"巴别塔！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"崩裂声，从轻到响。\n通天的巨塔不可能被几颗小小的炸弹撼动。但巨塔剥离了一缕根须，向渺小的人们垂了下来，形成了一条从甲板通往塔底的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"avg_003_kalts_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里，快！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"你们飞快地攀上垂落的塔底结构。\n出乎意料，那白色物体触感柔韧，仿佛......某种织物。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅——","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"上来！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我会抓住你。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米娅轻轻地触碰那“根须”。\n刹那之间，无数双手自海里，自塔上，自虚空伸向她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"闭上眼睛吧，阿米娅。\n\\n\\n闭上眼睛......\n魔王鞭策他们，魔王驱使他们，魔王奴役他们。\n\\n\\n魔王统御我们，魔王引领我们，魔王鼓舞我们。\n你已经来到此处。\n\\n\\n你已经来到我们中间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"众魂......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"源石的海洋近乎沸腾。\n众魂渴盼魔王。众魂想把魔王留下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——阿米娅，往前走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去见特蕾西娅殿下。得到答案，跨越答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"Logos先生......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我对殿下，亦有思念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们早已在多年前完成告别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时巴别塔尚未隐没于大地，最初的同僚们下定决心，将以生命践行理想。殿下与我，皆不例外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而众魂的声音......我会回应。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_4133_logos_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自我第一次唱响挽歌，我便在等待此刻。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_i18"},{"type":"narration","text":"众魂的意志自怒涛之下崛起。\n他们有的手持宝剑，有的役使巨兽，有的统帅千军。\n他们头戴相同的冠冕——\n他们是萨卡兹的君主。\n他们是萨卡兹的存续。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“无名的魔王”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"未有我们未曾踏过的路，未有我们未曾受过的苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“无名的魔王”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不可能比我们更强大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“无名的魔王”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你不可能比我们更无畏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他们审视，他们诘问。\n无数来自过往的情感凝结为实质的波涛，足以卷走任何个体的意志。\n可千万遍冲刷之后，他们面前的人依旧站立在原地。\n年轻的萨卡兹举起骨笔，指向所有无名的魔王。\n无需言语。\n他的咒言即是他的答复。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
